  "content": "<p>「嘟嘟的怪物」是一個模組，引入了在原版Minecraft中找不到的獨特地城和怪物。</p><p>&nbsp;</p><h3><strong>叢林監獄</strong></h3><p><strong>「叢林監獄是一個可以在叢林中找到的建築，裡面沉睡著名為骨頭奇美拉的新Boss。」</strong></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1349823/description_240dc4f8-0e20-4d1e-84ca-b1097092b48d.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"769\" height=\"411\"></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1349823/description_fa86323d-4f85-44f5-8562-fd558004d512.png\"></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1349823/description_116efdb2-591e-4812-8659-6779ca506a0d.png\"></p>",
